    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a pixelated mangrove on the brink of darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Cochi, a courageous crab knight on a mission to save his peaceful village by recovering the shattered fragments of the Tree of Life's Core. Wield a magical branch that transforms into multiple weapons, and prove that even a small hero can deliver a mighty blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat: Swap between unique weapons and fighting styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic boss battles: Face off against massive foes (and some quirky little ones).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming world: Discover handcrafted biomes filled with secrets and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro aesthetics: Beautiful pixel art and a soundtrack that blends nostalgic melodies with modern energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a heartfelt journey through lush mangroves, mystical ruins, and forgotten lands. Crab Knight is more than just a fight against darkness\u00a0 it\u2019s a celebration of resilience, nature, and a crab with a really cool stick.<br><br><br>This project was contemplated &quot;Edital Funcultura Audiovisual&quot; and has financial support from the Pernambuco State Government.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817620/extras/a2d2daf2061e7f5a1b4a9f795bcc3265.avif?t=1753383632\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into a pixelated mangrove on the brink of darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Cochi, a courageous crab knight on a mission to save his peaceful village by recovering the shattered fragments of the Tree of Life's Core. Wield a magical branch that transforms into multiple weapons, and prove that even a small hero can deliver a mighty blow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic combat: Swap between unique weapons and fighting styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic boss battles: Face off against massive foes (and some quirky little ones).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming world: Discover handcrafted biomes filled with secrets and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro aesthetics: Beautiful pixel art and a soundtrack that blends nostalgic melodies with modern energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a heartfelt journey through lush mangroves, mystical ruins, and forgotten lands. Crab Knight is more than just a fight against darkness\u00a0 it\u2019s a celebration of resilience, nature, and a crab with a really cool stick.<br><br><br>This project was contemplated &quot;Edital Funcultura Audiovisual&quot; and has financial support from the Pernambuco State Government.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817620/extras/a2d2daf2061e7f5a1b4a9f795bcc3265.avif?t=1753383632\" data-has-big width=800 height=160 /></span></p>",
